  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-heading">Day Hikes / Trips and Walks</div>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Bukit Pergasingan</strong> is a good overnight or sunrise hike near Sembalun. Around 2–3 hours to the summit with roughly 700 m elevation gain. Best done before or after a Mount Rinjani trek.</li>
      <li><strong>Tetebatu Rice Fields</strong> make an easy slower-paced day trip from Kuta or Senggigi. Expect village walks, rice terraces, small waterfalls, and local coffee farms. Around 2 hours by road from Kuta.</li>
      <li><strong>Sendang Gile and Tiu Kelep Waterfalls</strong> near Senaru are more dramatic than the southern waterfalls but require a longer drive. The walk includes river crossings and slippery rocks.</li>
      <li><strong>Secret Gilis</strong> off southwest Lombok are quieter than the main Gili Islands. Better for snorkelling and slower beach days. Boats usually depart from Sekotong.</li>
    </ul>
